     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:15.27272605896px;white-space:pre-wrap\">I would like to put a download button/link in the navbar. The attempt below does work but the position of the save icon is not great. This happens because Shiny is putting two links into the navbar. The first link is to a tab (which I don&#39;t need) and the second to the download link (which I do need).</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:15.27272605896px;white-space:pre-wrap\"> Each takes up space so I get the weird looking navbar. Any ideas?</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:15.27272605896px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:15.27272605896px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><div><span style=\"color:#000\">tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> downloadLink</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;downloadStateQuit&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;fa fa-save&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Save&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Qxm187Ck9nY/VaMkb0hQmgI/AAAAAAAABlI/SvGRiUWY_Tg/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2015-07-12%2Bat%2B7.36.38%2BPM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Qxm187Ck9nY/VaMkb0hQmgI/AAAAAAAABlI/SvGRiUWY_Tg/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2015-07-12%252Bat%252B7.36.38%252BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826538000&amp;usg=AOvVaw095pX2_7jEKhNpH1cEFYMV\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Qxm187Ck9nY/VaMkb0hQmgI/AAAAAAAABlI/SvGRiUWY_Tg/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2015-07-12%2Bat%2B7.36.38%2BPM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"120\"></a></p><div><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
