   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8000001907349px\">The power button is just an icon that links to a tab. When I tried to get it to do something else I had the same issue that the icon didn&#39;t align well. See</span><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/31374004/close-chrome-browser-window-on-navbar-click\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/31374004/close-chrome-browser-window-on-navbar-click&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2AEEyJVlPRSQn34rmf3y1y\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/31374004/close-chrome-browser-window-on-navbar-click</a></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\">@daattali had some very nice ideas which I plan to follow up on soon: <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/a/31374884/1974918\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/a/31374884/1974918&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2M4pfYWQJEo7rbFUaSFfCI\">http://stackoverflow.com/a/31374884/1974918</a></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\">This issue is also (somewhat) related to:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/888\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/888&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3sUeBYngEmuaZAkYvn5ZqO\">https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/888</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/891\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/891&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw063qsn7DjJpYSCSmmnQ5mz\">https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/891</a></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\">Some of these issues could be &#39;fixed&#39; by using ebailey/shinyMenus, thomasp85/shinyFiles, and daattali/shinyjs but I already have a fair number of dependencies and would prefer not to add more if I can avoid it.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_q51t9nos_0/VaSyAq5C6yI/AAAAAAAABmQ/hB1XGfpi77s/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2015-07-13%2Bat%2B1.09.35%2BPM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_q51t9nos_0/VaSyAq5C6yI/AAAAAAAABmQ/hB1XGfpi77s/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2015-07-13%252Bat%252B1.09.35%252BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aZY1z5MLAPZtxCrb37c0Y\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_q51t9nos_0/VaSyAq5C6yI/AAAAAAAABmQ/hB1XGfpi77s/s320/Screen%2BShot%2B2015-07-13%2Bat%2B1.09.35%2BPM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"89\"></a></p><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\">For now I&#39;m using navbarMenu:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/vnijs/radiant/blob/master/inst/base/global.R#L99-L116\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/vnijs/radiant/blob/master/inst/base/global.R%23L99-L116&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20XgeiunG4C0GyWuymW3HW\">https://github.com/vnijs/radiant/blob/master/inst/base/global.R#L99-L116</a></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\">This seems to work ok but I would prefer to replace the &#39;power-off&#39; menu with two icons directly in the navbar:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><a href=\"http://vnijs.rady.ucsd.edu:3838/quant/?SSUID=0eff8363bf\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vnijs.rady.ucsd.edu:3838/quant/?SSUID%3D0eff8363bf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2VLcVxJ6eIhTGeas_Rr9Xf\">http://vnijs.rady.ucsd.edu:3838/quant/?SSUID=0eff8363bf</a></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\">Some other related approaches that might also be of interest:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/gammarama/intRo/blob/master/ui.R\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/gammarama/intRo/blob/master/ui.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21YxqH94Y26Twnzv6r-nkM\">https://github.com/gammarama/intRo/blob/master/ui.R</a></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8000001907349px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/swarm-lab/editR/blob/master/inst/app/bits/navbar.R\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/swarm-lab/editR/blob/master/inst/app/bits/navbar.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-m6VwKDQusEQE4uetYdvV\">https://github.com/swarm-lab/editR/blob/master/inst/app/bits/navbar.R</a> (using <a href=\"https://github.com/ebailey78/shinyMenus\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ebailey78/shinyMenus&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397826540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QE-UEs0GKPj-MB55mWcTK\">https://github.com/ebailey78/shinyMenus</a>)</div></div>"
